"(`JointState`). MoveJ on `basic_joint_controller` is "
"`/{controller}/target_joint_position` (`std_msgs/Float64MultiArray`). "
"FSM: `/fsm_command` (`std_msgs/Int32`). Action / Service types and WBC "
"body/head topics: [FSM and Topics](4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
msgstr ""
"本技术栈没有统一的 `/target_pose` 或 "
"`/target_joint_positions`（`JointState`）。`basic_joint_controller` 上的 MoveJ"
" 是 "
"`/{controller}/target_joint_position`（`std_msgs/Float64MultiArray`）。FSM：`/fsm_command`（`std_msgs/Int32`）。Action"
" / Service 类型以及 WBC 身体/头部话题：[FSM 与话题](4-fsm_and_topics.md)。"

